        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>AHI SIG405-914-630, 36\" Contemporary Stainless Steel Door Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis 36 inch stainless steel door handle has 20 inch mounting centers. And since it is made out of stainless steel with a satin stainless steel finish, you can be sure that it will look good even in high-traffic commercial applications. But the 36 Inch Contemporary Stainless Steel Door Pull isn't just for office buildings and storefronts, it can also be used in residential applications too. It can be thru-bolt mounted, surface mounted, or back-to-back mounted on wood, fiberglass, glass, or metal doors. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/OMN-D900SAC-specifications.gif?v=1704354516\" width=\"426\" height=\"215\"  border=\"0\" alt=\"AHI SIG405-914 Contemporary Stainless Steel Door Pull Size\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available in other lengths: <a href=\"/products/14-inch-contemporary-stainless-steel-door-pull-ahi-sig405-355-630\"><b>14\" Door Pull</b></a> - <a href=\"/products/24-inch-contemporary-stainless-steel-door-pull-ahi-sig405-610-630\"><b>24\" Door Pull</b></a> - <a href=\"/products/48-inch-contemporary-stainless-steel-door-pull-ahi-sig405-1220-630\"><b>48\" Door Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the AHI SIG405-914-630 Contemporary Door Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Stainless Stee Tubing</li>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Satin Stainless Steel</b></li> \r\n<li>Total Height: 36\" (914 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Centers: 20\" (508)</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 3\" (76 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Handle Diameter: 1-1/4\" (27 mm) Round</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/AHI-SIG405-914-specifications.pdf?v=1691093352\"><b>AHI SIG405-914 Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Mounting Hardware:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Surface Mounting:</b> Pull screws to the face of the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Back to Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. <b>Requires 2 pulls</b>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<a href=\"/pages/how-to-mount-and-install-door-pulls\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/pull-mounting-hardware.gif?v=1774579796\" width=\"600\" height=\"150\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Door Pull Mounting Hardware\"></a>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually (1 door pull handle). If you order Back-to-Back Mounting please Order 2 Pulls.</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "36 Inch Contemporary Stainless Steel Door Pull, AHI SIG405-914-630",
                "description": "This 36 inch stainless steel door handle has 20 inch mounting centers. And since it is made out of stainless steel with a satin stainless steel finish, you can be sure that it will look good even in high-traffic commercial applications. But the 36 Inch Contemporary Stainless Steel Door Pull isn't just for office buildings and storefronts, it can also be used in residential applications too. It can be thru-bolt mounted, surface mounted, or back-to-back mounted on wood, glass, or metal doors. \r\n",
